<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>悦容美发美容 - 广州专业美发美容沙龙</title>
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
:root {
  --gold: #c9a96e;
  --gold-light: #e8d5b0;
  --dark: #2c2c2c;
  --darker: #1a1a1a;
  --cream: #faf7f2;
  --rose: #d4a0a0;
  --white: #ffffff;
  --gray: #6b6b6b;
  --light-gray: #f5f3f0;
}
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Hiragino Sans GB", sans-serif; color: var(--dark); background: var(--cream); line-height: 1.7; }
a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
ul { list-style: none; }

/* Navigation */
.navbar {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 1000;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,169,110,0.2);
  padding: 0 60px; height: 72px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
}
.nav-logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); letter-spacing: 2px; }
.nav-logo span { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
.nav-links a { font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); transition: color 0.3s; font-weight: 500; }
.nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-cta {
  background: var(--gold); color: var(--white) !important; padding: 10px 28px;
  border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: #b8944f; transform: translateY(-1px); }

/* Hero */
.hero {
  min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #2d2520 50%, #3a2f28 100%);
  padding: 100px 60px 60px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -20%;
  width: 800px; height: 800px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,169,110,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
}
.hero::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -30%; left: -10%;
  width: 600px; height: 600px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,160,160,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
}
.hero-content { max-width: 700px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.hero-tag {
  display: inline-block; border: 1px solid var(--gold); color: var(--gold);
  padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 2px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 28px; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.hero h1 { font-size: 52px; color: var(--white); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--gold); }
.hero p { font-size: 18px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 540px; }
.hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--gold); color: var(--white); padding: 16px 40px;
  border-radius: 4px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; border: none;
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-block;
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: #b8944f; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(201,169,110,0.3); }
.btn-outline {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); color: var(--white); padding: 16px 40px;
  border-radius: 4px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-block;
}
.btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }

/* Stats */
.stats {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0;
  background: var(--white); margin: -60px 60px 0; position: relative; z-index: 10;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;
}
.stat-item { padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid #f0ede8; }
.stat-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
.stat-num { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.stat-label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); }

/* Sections */
.section { padding: 100px 60px; }
.section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 64px; }
.section-tag {
  font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;
}
.section-title { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.section-desc { font-size: 16px; color: var(--gray); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }

/* Services Preview */
.services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
.service-card {
  background: var(--white); border-radius: 8px; padding: 40px 32px;
  transition: all 0.3s; border: 1px solid #f0ede8;
}
.service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-color: var(--gold-light); }
.service-icon {
  width: 56px; height: 56px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-light), var(--gold));
  border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--white);
}
.service-card h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; }
.service-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.service-price { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); }
.service-price small { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); font-weight: 400; }

/* About Section */
.about { background: var(--white); }
.about-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
.about-img {
  width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8d5b0, #d4c5a0);
  border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 60px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
}
.about-text h2 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
.about-text p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.about-features { margin-top: 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
.about-feat { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
.about-feat::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }

/* Testimonials */
.testimonials { background: var(--darker); }
.testimonials .section-title { color: var(--white); }
.testimonials .section-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
.testi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
.testi-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px;
}
.testi-stars { color: var(--gold); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.testi-text { font-size: 15px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.8; }
.testi-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.testi-avatar {
  width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold-light);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark);
}
.testi-name { font-size: 15px; color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; }
.testi-service { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

/* CTA */
.cta-section {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #d4a056);
  padding: 80px 60px; text-align: center;
}
.cta-section h2 { font-size: 36px; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.cta-section p { font-size: 17px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 32px; }
.btn-white {
  background: var(--white); color: var(--dark); padding: 16px 44px;
  border-radius: 4px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-block;
}
.btn-white:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }

/* Info */
.info-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 40px; }
.info-card { text-align: center; }
.info-icon { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.info-card h4 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.info-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); }

/* Footer */
.footer {
  background: var(--darker); padding: 60px 60px 30px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
}
.footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
.footer-brand h3 { font-size: 22px; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.footer-brand h3 span { color: var(--gold); }
.footer-brand p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; }
.footer h4 { font-size: 15px; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.footer ul li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.footer ul li a { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); transition: color 0.3s; }
.footer ul li a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.footer-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top: 24px;
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 13px;
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .navbar { padding: 0 30px; }
  .hero { padding: 100px 30px 60px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 40px; }
  .section { padding: 70px 30px; }
  .stats { margin: -40px 30px 0; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .about-wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  .testi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .info-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .navbar { padding: 0 20px; }
  .nav-links { gap: 20px; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 13px; }
  .hero { padding: 90px 20px 50px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
  .section { padding: 60px 20px; }
  .stats { margin: -30px 20px 0; }
  .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .footer { padding: 40px 20px 20px; }
  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; text-align: center; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar">
  <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">悦容<span>·</span>美发美容</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="index.html" class="active">首页</a></li>
    <li><a href="services.html">服务项目</a></li>
    <li><a href="team.html">团队介绍</a></li>
    <li><a href="booking.html" class="nav-cta">立即预约</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-tag">广州 · 专业美发美容沙龙</div>
    <h1>让每一次造型<br>都成为<em>你的高光时刻</em></h1>
    <p>悦容美发美容，专注个性化发型设计与高端护肤护理，汇聚资深造型师团队，用专业与匠心为您打造专属美丽。</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="booking.html" class="btn-primary">预约服务</a>
      <a href="services.html" class="btn-outline">查看价目表</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">12+</div>
    <div class="stat-label">年专业经验</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">50,000+</div>
    <div class="stat-label">服务客户</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">8</div>
    <div class="stat-label">资深造型师</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">4.9</div>
    <div class="stat-label">客户满意度评分</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag">我们的服务</div>
    <div class="section-title">为您精心打造的专业项目</div>
    <div class="section-desc">从日常修剪到高端造型，从深层护理到焕肤美颜，满足您的一切美丽需求</div>
  </div>
  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">✂</div>
      <h3>专业剪发</h3>
      <p>根据脸型、发质与风格偏好，量身定制专属发型设计，让每一次剪发都是一次焕新。</p>
      <div class="service-price">¥88 起 <small>/ 次</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">🎨</div>
      <h3>时尚染发</h3>
      <p>进口环保染剂，多色混搭与渐变技法，打造自然高级的时尚发色，显白又有质感。</p>
      <div class="service-price">¥298 起 <small>/ 次</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">✨</div>
      <h3>深层护理</h3>
      <p>头皮检测 + 深层滋养 + 蛋白修复，让秀发从根源恢复强韧光泽，告别干枯毛躁。</p>
      <div class="service-price">¥228 起 <small>/ 次</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">🌿</div>
      <h3>面部护肤</h3>
      <p>专业肤质分析，搭配定制护理方案，补水、美白、抗衰一站式解决肌肤问题。</p>
      <div class="service-price">¥168 起 <small>/ 次</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">💫</div>
      <h3>烫发造型</h3>
      <p>数码烫、法式烫、韩式纹理烫，柔韧不伤发，自然蓬松有层次，持久好看。</p>
